# The script the gate has the fixture set's editor run in its headless mode
# for the package `word-count` (tools/package-set.sh run): it types three
# words into the scratch buffer and runs the package's command, which says
# the count in the echo area, exactly `expected`. It touches no file.

reload
settle

key i KeyI -
commit one two  three
key <Escape> Escape -
run word-count
scene
